From 336c29295791f83ac092df3c312bc8cebbe6b7cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 06:05:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 19: Locked folder with biometric protection

- Private folder in app storage (files/locked): invisible to other apps and MediaStore, excluded from backups
- Move to Locked folder: copies first, then asks the system to delete the originals; declining rolls the copies back
- Unlock restores items to the gallery; delete removes them permanently
- BiometricPrompt (strong biometrics or screen lock) gates the album and viewer; FLAG_SECURE hides it from screenshots and recents
- Session re-locks when the app leaves the foreground or the user leaves the Locked folder
- Lock action in selection bar and viewer; Locked folder card in Albums
- Selection controller built through a factory; viewer action bar refactored
- README updated
